Checker: $(jq -r '.failures[]? | "- " + .' <<<"$VERDICT")
Tests: ${FP:-?} passed, ${FF:-?} failed (base ${BP:-?} passed). $( [[ "$TESTS" == pass ]] && echo "These pass." || echo "The suite must pass with no fewer checks than the base." )
Second opinion (another model family): $(jq -r '.result // empty' "$OUT/second-opinion.json" 2>/dev/null | head -c 2500)
Update fix.md so it names each finding and what you did about it." 4
    FIX_ROUND_TAG=" revision"; fix_review
